{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1795031405","published":"2026-11-18T19:50:18Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:45.400738587Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-113425","CVE-2026-118899","CVE-2026-123007","CVE-2026-123634","CVE-2026-123640","CVE-2026-125283"],"summary":"Fix of 5 CVEs","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory corruption in HTTP/2 flow control\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-123007.patch: account for frames queued but\n       not yet sent when validating a client WINDOW_UPDATE, so refunding\n       them on stream termination can no longer push the connection send\n       window above NGX_HTTP_V2_MAX_WINDOW\n     - CVE-2026-123007\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free during response processing in resolver\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-123634.patch: release a non-current resolve\n       finalized from another resolve handler through a finalizer instead of\n       reporting it, and report an error to waiting requests when restarting\n       a resolve with a CNAME fails\n     - CVE-2026-123634\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in mail proxy module\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-113425.patch: block client writes while\n       waiting for the auth_http response, while connecting to the upstream\n       and while resolving the SMTP client, discard the queued reply when an\n       auth_http request starts, and switch the client handlers when a\n       session is quitting\n       (includes the nginx 1.17.3 SMTP read-blocking change it builds on)\n     - CVE-2026-113425\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: buffer overflow with try_files and alias\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-125283.patch: recalculate the length after\n       running the script\n     - CVE-2026-125283\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: endless loop while reading the request body over\n     SSL\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-118899.patch: explicit handling of\n       NGX_AGAIN\n     - CVE-2026-118899\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: ClientHello parsing differential in ssl_preread\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-123640.patch: forbid trailing data in\n       extensions and duplicate SNI/ALPN\n     - CVE-2026-123640","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.0-0ubuntu1.11+tuxcare.els14"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1795031405.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.0-0ubuntu1.11+tuxcare.els14"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1795031405.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.0-0ubuntu1.11+tuxcare.els14"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1795031405.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-echo","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-echo?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.0-0ubuntu1.11+tuxcare.els14"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1795031405.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-fancyindex","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-fancyindex?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.14.0-0ubuntu1.11+tuxcare.els14"}]}],"database_specific":{"sourc